T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. The Epistemological Boundary:) Tj
T*
(   The choice between Present Perfect and Simple Past dictates whether an experiment is viewed as) Tj
T*
(   a detached historical event or as living evidence shaping contemporary scientific) Tj
T*
(   understanding.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Rules for Tense Selection:) Tj
