(   [Problem Statement]: Analyze the Future Perfect and Future Continuous tenses in grant proposals and translational timeline projections.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Strategic Function in Research Grant Applications:) Tj
T*
(   Grant proposals \(e.g., NIH, DBT, Horizon Europe\) demand rigorous milestone roadmaps) Tj
T*
(   demonstrating project feasibility within fixed timelines.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Grammatical Formulations:) Tj
T*
(   - Future Continuous \(will be + present participle\): Indicates an ongoing research operation) Tj
T*
(   across an extended operational interval:) Tj
T*
(   - "During Quarter 2, our research team will be harvesting cellular biomass from continuous-feed) Tj
T*
(   bioreactors.") Tj
T*
