T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Timeless Scientific Reality:) Tj
T*
(   Mathematical equations, structural formulas, algorithmic computational rules, and biological) Tj
T*
(   reaction mechanisms exist outside historical time; they represent permanent intellectual) Tj
T*
(   constructs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Syntax of Theoretical Explanations:) Tj
T*
(   - Always formulate governing models in the Simple Present:) Tj
T*
(   - "The Michaelis-Menten model assumes that the enzyme and substrate form an intermediate) Tj
T*
(   complex.") Tj
T*
(   - "The Henderson-Hasselbalch equation relates pH, pKa, and buffer equilibrium.") Tj
T*
(   - "The algorithm aligns nucleotide sequences by optimizing global gap penalties.") Tj
T*
