(   [Problem Statement]: Discuss subtle tense shifts when reporting historical controversies and scientific paradigm shifts.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. The Rhetorical Challenge of Paradigm Shifts:) Tj
T*
(   Scientific historiography requires navigating the cognitive gap between historical consensus) Tj
T*
(   \(now known to be false\) and current empirical reality.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Syntax of Superseded vs. Modern Knowledge:) Tj
T*
(   - Superseded Belief \(Past Simple throughout\):) Tj
T*
(   - "For decades, physicians believed that stress caused gastric ulcers.") Tj
T*
(   - \(Notice: 'caused' is past simple because stress is no longer accepted as the primary cause\).) Tj
T*
(   - The Modern Breakthrough \(Past Simple for event + Present Simple for universal mechanism\):) Tj
T*
(   - "In 1982, Marshall and Warren discovered that Helicobacter pylori colonizes the gastric) Tj
T*
(   mucosa and causes peptic ulceration.") Tj
T*
(   - \(Notice: 'colonizes' and 'causes' are in the Simple Present because H. pylori continues to) Tj
T*
(   cause ulcers today\).) Tj
T*
(   - Contrast: Writing "*believed that stress causes ulcers" would imply that stress still causes) Tj
T*
(   ulcers today.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F2 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(>> Solution to Question 28:) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Analyze the syntax and mechanics of conditional sentences expressing habit or typical routine behavior.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Habitual Conditionals:) Tj
T*
(   - Formula: If / Whenever + [Present Simple], ... [Present Simple] \(or Past Simple / Past Simple) Tj
T*
(   for historical habits\).) Tj
T*
(   - Function: Describes regular, predictable, repeated occurrences rather than single isolated) Tj
T*
(   events.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Applied Scientific Laboratory Habits:) Tj
T*
(   - Present Habitual:) Tj
T*
(   - "Whenever the cleanroom pressure drops below 15 Pa, the differential alarm chimes) Tj
T*
(   automatically.") Tj
T*
